From: Dict Xiong <me@dxng.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: airoha: keep PON manual calibration in USXGMII mode

The upstream PCS sequence now enables manual RX calibration for ETH and
PON SerDes through E2 silicon, with PON RX-lock recovery. Keep those
changes and the updated crossing-search calibration sequence.

Retain the product guard from the original pre-E2 PON fix: only consume
the PON manual-calibration flag for USXGMII Ethernet links. Optical PON
modes retain their separate calibration paths. The existing ETH policy
and upstream revision threshold are unchanged.

The PON enablement was inspired by the related YYH implementation by
Gilly and Yanghan Ye; this guard remains a scoped adaptation.

Link: https://github.com/YYH2913/openwrt/commit/fa1edae89eb8765ff6a773a5172bd706a1306503
Signed-off-by: Dict Xiong <me@dxng.cn>
Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
---
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-an7581.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-an7581.c
@@ -3347,8 +3347,14 @@
 				   int index, phy_interface_t interface)
 {
 	struct regmap *pcs_pma = priv->pcs_pma[index];
+	bool manual_rx_calib;
 	int calibration_try = 0;
 	u32 val = 0;
+
+	/* Preserve the existing calibration policy for optical PON modes. */
+	manual_rx_calib = priv->manual_rx_calib &&
+		(priv->data->port_type != AIROHA_PCS_PON ||
+		 interface == PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_USXGMII);
 
 	an7581_pcs_tx_bringup(priv, index, interface);
 	an7581_pcs_rx_bringup(priv, index, interface);
@@ -3358,7 +3364,7 @@
 	usleep_range(100, 200);
 
 retry_calibration:
-	an7581_pcs_cdr_reset(priv, index, interface, priv->manual_rx_calib);
+	an7581_pcs_cdr_reset(priv, index, interface, manual_rx_calib);
 
 	/* Global reset clear */
 	regmap_update_bits(pcs_pma, AIROHA_PCS_PMA_SW_RST_SET,
@@ -3400,7 +3406,7 @@
 	/* Manual RX calibration is required for SoC revisions through E2.
 	 * E3+ SoCs autocalibrate RX and only CDR reset is needed.
 	 */
-	if (!priv->manual_rx_calib)
+	if (!manual_rx_calib)
 		return 0;
 
 	/* It was discovered that after a global reset and auto mode gets
